2. Free use of the program

Anyone may download, install, and run the Software, without a license fee,
for personal, educational, research, noncommercial, or commercial work.
This includes searching, indexing, and analyzing private, proprietary,
or open-source projects, and using ReSearchify with code assistants.

You may freely redistribute complete, unmodified Official Binary packages,
provided that you distribute them free of charge, include this license and
all copyright notices, identify ReSearchify as the original project, and
do not suggest that you are the original author or are endorsed by the author.

3. Source access and contributions

You may view and download the source, compile it, inspect it, test it,
debug it, and make private modifications for learning, evaluating, or
improving ReSearchify. You may run builds made from those private
modifications.

You may prepare and submit patches and pull requests to the original
ReSearchify project. Forking within GitHub for viewing and contributing is
permitted subject to GitHub's Terms of Service.

